@* Project-root imports for the shared screens.

   These came from the desktop host's own root _Imports.razor. Razor resolves component tags
   (NavLink and friends) from @using directives rather than C# global usings, so moving the
   screens into this library without bringing this file along left NavLink unrecognised. *@
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Routing
@using static Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web.RenderMode
